\b0\fs20\cf2 End User License and Rig Deployment Agreement\par
\pard\sa140\sl240\slmult1\fs18 
This software and associated high-speed camera drivers are provided for test rig PC operations, needle-free injector spray angle verification, and piston velocity analysis.\par
\b Grant of License:\b0\par
You are granted a non-exclusive license to install and execute this software on laboratory PCs and test rigs.\par
\b Data Integrity and Recording:\b0\par
The software includes automated calibration persistence and high-speed burst frame recording into dedicated user-writable directories without requiring elevated Windows administrative permissions during test operations.\par
\b Camera Drivers:\b0\par
Integrated USB3 Vision and CoaXPress device driver installers are provided under respective manufacturer licenses.\par
